    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join us on discord</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Socialize: Poly is the first opus of the Socialize Franchise, the first life ropleplaying franchise!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897780/extras/19e287f54b7f3a9b8b8b8461b75150e2.poster.avif?t=1662290446\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897780/extras/19e287f54b7f3a9b8b8b8461b75150e2.webm?t=1662290446\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897780/extras/19e287f54b7f3a9b8b8b8461b75150e2.mp4?t=1662290446\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Socialize: Poly is all about <strong>freedom</strong>, join a server and start your new life!<br>Create your digital self, start a business with your friends, grab a coffee and explore this world together.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897780/extras/72267a067acf7e6bc2d5a34b16ea1261.poster.avif?t=1662290446\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897780/extras/72267a067acf7e6bc2d5a34b16ea1261.webm?t=1662290446\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897780/extras/72267a067acf7e6bc2d5a34b16ea1261.mp4?t=1662290446\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897780/extras/9488ad9525d379764584748120d47c4b.poster.avif?t=1662290446\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897780/extras/9488ad9525d379764584748120d47c4b.webm?t=1662290446\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897780/extras/9488ad9525d379764584748120d47c4b.mp4?t=1662290446\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Purchase cars, bikes, trucks, trailers and <strong>customize</strong> them as you wish!<br>Change the color, the wheels and their paint to to make a <strong>unique vehicle</strong> that match your style.<br><br>And drive around in your car with our realistic driving system!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897780/extras/6425be7ad7ce964595b06d502996ca56.poster.avif?t=1662290446\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897780/extras/6425be7ad7ce964595b06d502996ca56.webm?t=1662290446\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897780/extras/6425be7ad7ce964595b06d502996ca56.mp4?t=1662290446\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897780/extras/6505eae67de95fd662dad62cf54efd72.poster.avif?t=1662290446\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897780/extras/6505eae67de95fd662dad62cf54efd72.webm?t=1662290446\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897780/extras/6505eae67de95fd662dad62cf54efd72.mp4?t=1662290446\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Purchase a <strong>property</strong> like a house, an office, a store, and customize it as you wish!",
